00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:18.100
With all that out of the way now, I want to
dig deep into Luffy's power and what the Nika

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:23.050
Nika fruit is actually based on. Because the
internet has researched this name to death

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:28.600
and it's not an obvious mythical creature
like a phoenix or a dragon.

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:33.100
It seems like Nika is a mixture of a couple
of different ideas. One element is that of

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:39.240
the buddhist wisdom king deity. Hyogoro calls
luffy wisdom king myo for instance. It's also

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:44.880
referenced by Enel, who has a wisdom king
slash buddha like form, who also calls himself

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:50.910
a god.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:56.269
And Skypea of course was the arc that has
the famous panel, where Luffy looks like Nika

00:16:56.269 --> 00:17:02.351
which is again referenced in this chapter.
Since wisdom kings have fiery hair too, that

00:17:02.351 --> 00:17:05.300
might explain that part of his ability as
well.

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:10.970
Another part of Nika, might be inspired by
the Olmecs, one of the oldest known civilisations

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:17.580
in the americas. The word olmec literally
means Rubber People in English, as they actually

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:22.250
were able to produce rubber and cultivate
rubber trees. It also might be a nod to the

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:27.780
aztec god of rubber, who is called *deep breath
in* Tlauixcalpantecuhtli. Nailed it.

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:32.660
This god's name translated means the lord
of the house of the dawn, which fits pretty

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:38.700
nicely to the one who brings the dawn, dont
you think? This god was also associated with

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:43.810
the sun gods, representing the Eastern cardinal
direction. Not only would that tie in nicely

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:49.700
with Dragon's aztec tattoo and Luffy being
from Brazil, but the dawn is also the sun

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:53.530
rising in the east. Luffy coming form the
east blue.

00:17:53.530 --> 00:18:00.030
So we might know what Nika is inspired by,
but what are Luffy's actual powers? Because

